# Rooby Studio — Project Overview

## What This Is

A personal Jekyll blog hosted on GitHub Pages at **https://roobystudio.com**.

- **Theme:** `jekyll-theme-chirpy` v7.4+
- **Stack:** Jekyll (Ruby), Liquid templates, Kramdown + Rouge
- **Deployment:** GitHub Actions → GitHub Pages (`.github/workflows/pages-deploy.yml`)
- **Comments:** Giscus (GitHub Discussions)
- **Analytics:** GoatCounter (`id: boyu`)
- **PWA:** enabled with offline cache

## Directory Structure

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `_posts/` | All blog posts (`YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`) |
| `_tabs/` | Nav tabs — `tech`, `studio`, `journal`, `archives`, `categories`, `tags`, `about` |
| `_layouts/` | Custom Jekyll layouts |
| `_includes/` | Liquid partials |
| `_data/` | YAML data files (authors, contact, share) |
| `_plugins/` | Jekyll plugins |
| `assets/images/headers/` | Post header images (one per post, named after the slug) |
| `assets/images/` | In-body images |
| `assets/demos/` | Embedded interactive demos (e.g. Exp-Z) |
| `pages/` | Standalone pages (e.g. `stack.md`) |
| `tools/` | Build/utility scripts (excluded from Jekyll build) |

## Content Tracks

The site has two main tracks, reflected in categories and nav tabs:

| Track | Tab | Typical Categories |
|-------|-----|--------------------|
| Tech | `tech` | Tech, Java, API, Design, Demo, Agile |
| Life & Music | `studio` / `journal` | Studio, Journal, Thoughts, Philosophy, Leadership |

## Key Config Facts

- **Permalink:** `/posts/:title/`
- **Timezone:** `Asia/Hong_Kong` (`+0800`)
- **Author default:** `boyu` (set globally in `_config.yml`)
- **Syntax highlighting:** Rouge, with line numbers enabled on blocks
- **Pagination:** 10 posts per page
- **Plugin:** `jekyll-redirect-from` (for legacy URL redirects)
- **TOC:** enabled globally for all posts

## What NOT to Touch

- `_site/` — auto-generated, never edit directly
- `*.gemspec`, `package*.json`, `purgecss.js` — excluded from Jekyll build
- `tools/` — build utilities, not site content
